:: Dad Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> are walking along talking when he asks you <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So, what’s next on the agenda, bud?”</span> You pause for a moment, thinking, before saying that you were actually planning to end this hang out session, if he doesn’t mind. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> chuckles at this, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What? Had enough of hanging out with your old man?”</span> You quickly explain that isn’t it, you really had fun with him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I know, I’m just kidding. I had fun too, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$DadNickname</span>. Thanks for inviting me out!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He laughs some more, ruffling your hair.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Dad",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Glad to see you aren’t completely embarrassed about being seen around me. When Gabe was your age, he used to act like he was going to DIE if his friends even saw me in the same car as him. He used to duck in cover whenever we drove by someone he knew.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> reminiscences for a moment, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Good times. Well, I’ll head home then. Probably get some cleaning done. Have fun! I love you!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Suddenly, Dad pulls you into a big, tight bear hug that lifts you off the ground.</span> <br>
<br>


<div id="choice">
	<<link "Hug him back<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">You hug <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> back, despite being in public. You’re not totally against showing him love… in the right settings.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Awwww, have fun my cute little man!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> somehow makes the situation even more embarrassing, though you continue to hug him and just pray none of your friends see you like this. Eventually, he releases you and you are able to breathe once more. <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Dad",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:Pink">He gives you one last wave before walking off with a bit of pep in his step. You can tell you made him happy.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Act embarrassed<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You act as any kid would when being hugged in such a way in public: <span style="color:LightGreen">embarrassed. You cry out and try to free yourself from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Dad</span>’s grasp, but he is just too strong.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, don’t tell me NOW you’re embarrassed? And just when I was starting to feel loved.”</span> He laughs, adding extra layers to your embarrassment by lifting you higher off the ground and planting a big wet kiss on your cheeks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Who’s my loveably little man? So mature and grown up!”</span> <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Dad",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 2,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        Thankfully, you don’t see anyone you recognize witnessing this and he eventually lets you go with only a few bruised ribs and a wet cheek. <span style="color:LightGreen">You quickly wipe it off as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> ruffles your hair one last time before walking off. He can be so embarrassing sometimes! But hey, that’s what dad’s do.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>